### 查询 V1 采购订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-direct-fulfillment/orders/v1/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":{"createdAfter":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z"}}

### 查询 V1 采购订单详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-direct-fulfillment/orders/v1/purchase-orders/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"purchaseOrderNumber":"PO-1"}}

### 提交 V1 订单确认
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-direct-fulfillment/orders/v1/acknowledgements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"acknowledgements":[]}}

### 查询 2021-12-28 采购订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-direct-fulfillment/orders/2021-12-28/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":{"createdAfter":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z"}}

### 查询 2021-12-28 采购订单详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-direct-fulfillment/orders/2021-12-28/purchase-orders/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pathParams":{"purchaseOrderNumber":"PO-1"}}

### 提交 2021-12-28 订单确认
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-direct-fulfillment/orders/2021-12-28/acknowledgements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"acknowledgements":[]}}
